  "intro": {
    "eyebrow": "The idea",
    "note": "Most people pick the place, then fight the season. We start the other way round: from the month you can go.",
    "statement": "Timing is the whole trip.",
    "ledeHtml": "The same island is a postcard in May and a crush in August. The same city is golden in October and shuttered in February. Read against your own calendar: Diwali, the winter break, the long May–June school holidays, the scattered long weekends, the question is rarely <em>where</em>. It is <em>when</em>, and what's at its best then. Here is the year, month by month, with the flights and the visas each one asks for."
  },
